      <Placemark>
        <name>Peep Show</name>
        <description>Canterbury House, Sydenham Road.                  The office where Sophie and Mark first met. JLB moved buildings a few times in later series, but this will always be the original. Now being converted to flats so its interior, where they shot on location, is long gone.</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -0.0976995,51.3775232,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Peep Show</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Loop Bar<br>(“Shooshh”, Crown Hill). Where Mark plays pool (badly) with his nemesis Jeff. You probably can’t play pool there anymore, unfortunately, but it's still one of Croydon's more lively nightspots. ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -0.1012038,51.3737369,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Peep Show</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Registry office where Jez marries Nancy<br>(Former Croydon Registry Office, Mint walk) Sadly demolished to make way for Croydon Council's new headquarters but at least that saves Jez from some pretty painful memories. ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -0.1000249,51.3717419,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
